WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Read the exact accepted version
Confirm the selected store, read the policy and check the acceptance
receipt. Acceptance covers this store only. A new version needs a new
acceptance and never silently changes earlier order targets.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Reply with useful evidence
Choose Reply and explain the evidence for reviewers. This English form
contains a demonstration draft. Sending a response does not resolve the
case, approve a payout or move money.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Ask for a recorded warning to be reconsidered
An unappealed warning allows one appeal, even after resolution. Choose
Appeal a warning, explain why, and wait for human review. A dismissed
warning cannot be appealed again.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Use your workspace evidence queue
Review missing documents and other exceptions belonging to your
organization and active store. Private staff identifiers, buyer details,
bank data and compliance-file secrets are not exposed here.
